    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad7ae55c386d9747319db74b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "米浴跑完了“出道战”，\n成功踏出了最初的一步。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3430b6044449cc288444e4f323e8a32769d5ae7e032df2ca722b4a43db6844fe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1030/storytimeline_501030416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97e33fa0e90b78ab36c8aee9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "几天后。\n米浴前去观看同年出道的赛马娘中，\n最受注目的美浦波旁的出道战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8558e38975e3cd7828f22072b6998006a31167c9fa2a35515acaf4377837f7bb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1030/storytimeline_501030416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4132a8f35ea3c25f9b127a4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看着她带给人们笑容的奔跑身影，\n米浴下定决心要参加经典赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "417267e4aba0f7ec0f327c9c9d4718872667bfa51ebe13523a004a2f87c755ea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1030/storytimeline_501030416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b93476245a254dc12b92d2e8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以追上美浦波旁为目标……\n她决定要参加三冠路线前哨战的“春季S”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef389625dd51ff516b74fc228ecbac994153c8fc118e04f983dd2a274ec108bf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1030/storytimeline_501030416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd1a2cb2395554e250a1820e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "出道战结束后・踏出改变的第一步",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb3242c901211312eb8bd2fe674a069fc92f82e64d84abd0b28f64b67d910d23",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1030/storytimeline_501030416.json",
