    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5fe1410f6ad15d403fee59b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "米浴结束“春季S”的比赛。\n不只清楚了解到今后该努力的方向，\n也燃起了要更加努力的斗志。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04bdd03a58c69061771e456479c0399475cb4dda95003a17aeb37bff8368adca",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1030/storytimeline_501030417.json",
