    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7e033a9f9518b37823ebb70",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "米浴推翻观众们认为\n目白麦昆会夺得三连霸的预测，\n漂亮地拿下胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9c2f6b22fe6a532dc1941c537685ed6c05b52aaa46eb6394d6e42806da46ab1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1030/storytimeline_501030423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28dcb0c1591ab7a22b9de55f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "米浴收到粉丝和朋友们的祝福，\n得知自己也能带给大家笑容，\n因此感慨不已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ac3761ca1b37a985a5a70f503aa5066edb1163308f9d58dc3d2df0a81953bdc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1030/storytimeline_501030423.json",
      "json_path": [
