      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "带给许多观众笑容的她，\n总算成为了她梦寐以求的“蓝蔷薇”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a07808526b9a2669fa260b357faad365dd67741a381387a54ab03259f215566",
