      "uid": "zhcn:db47e2cac31fb0b9f05c3e4a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“有马纪念”和“宝冢纪念”相同，\n都是在粉丝投票获得高支持度的\n赛马娘才能出场的比赛──",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ff331ae74953bf22ca5c0856d1244e63dca791f0b1796fe70ad38869ab1e06f",
